  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "James Cook University Singapore is the Singapore campus of James Cook University (Australia) and the only overseas institution with full university status in Singapore. Established in 2003 as the James Cook Institute of Higher Learning, it gained full university status in 2016 following the Singapore-Australia Free Trade Agreement review. The campus is located at 149 Sims Drive between Kallang and Geylang.",
      "JCU Singapore operates on a trimester system with intakes in March, July, and November — allowing students to complete a Bachelor's in two years and a Master's in one. All degrees awarded are accredited by JCU Australia, giving graduates an Australian university qualification while studying in Singapore.",
      "Academic strengths span Business, Information Technology, Psychology, Education, Tourism and Hospitality, Environmental Science, and Aquaculture — the latter leveraging JCU Australia's world-leading tropical and marine science reputation. The campus runs a psychology clinic open to the public, offering counselling services at reduced rates and providing supervised practical training for Psychology students.",
      "JCU Singapore is ranked 445th in the QS World University Rankings (2024–2025) and hosts approximately 4,200 students from over 50 countries, with a 78.8% graduate employment rate (2022/2023). The international, English-medium cohort makes Sims Drive a strong choice for students wanting an Australian degree in the heart of Asia."
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "James Cook University Singapore — сингапурский кампус австралийского James Cook University и единственное иностранное учреждение со статусом полноценного университета в Сингапуре. Основан в 2003 как James Cook Institute of Higher Learning, статус университета — с 2016 (после ревизии Singapore-Australia Free Trade Agreement). Кампус расположен на 149 Sims Drive между Kallang и Geylang.",
      "JCU Singapore работает по тримеcтровой системе с интейками в марте, июле и ноябре — Bachelor можно закончить за 2 года, Master — за 1 год. Все дипломы выдаются JCU Australia, то есть студент получает австралийскую квалификацию, обучаясь в Сингапуре.",
      "Сильные направления — Business, Information Technology, Psychology, Education, Tourism and Hospitality, Environmental Science и Aquaculture (последнее опирается на мировой авторитет JCU Australia в tropical и marine science). На кампусе работает psychology clinic, открытая для публики — там студенты Psychology проходят supervised practice.",
      "JCU Singapore занимает 445-е место в QS World University Rankings (2024–2025), на кампусе около 4,200 студентов из более чем 50 стран, employment rate выпускников — 78.8% (2022/2023). Международная англоязычная среда делает Sims Drive сильным выбором для тех, кто хочет австралийский диплом в сердце Азии."
    ],
